WEBVTT

01:46.120 --> 01:46.789
Look.

01:47.430 --> 01:49.870
This paper was torn in half.

01:50.920 --> 01:51.680
I suspect

01:52.229 --> 01:54.490
Uncle Deng wanted
to leave you a message.

01:56.789 --> 01:57.479
Could it be

01:59.920 --> 02:02.050
Father was trying to write something?

02:02.680 --> 02:03.880
I discovered earlier

02:04.310 --> 02:06.590
that Father was hiding something
about Baicao Valley.

02:06.590 --> 02:08.320
But no matter how I pressed him,

02:08.680 --> 02:10.150
he never told me.

02:11.470 --> 02:12.310
Maybe

02:13.470 --> 02:15.000
Father finally came around

02:16.470 --> 02:18.200
and wanted to tell us the truth.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.430
Liu Suifeng!

02:28.360 --> 02:29.870
If he killed Uncle Deng,

02:31.310 --> 02:32.710
no matter where he hides,

02:34.750 --> 02:36.280
I'll avenge your father.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.090
Big Brother,

02:40.590 --> 02:41.710
are you saying

02:42.870 --> 02:44.520
we can't be sure it was him?

02:48.590 --> 02:50.320
My father had no other enemies.

02:51.710 --> 02:53.170
Aside from the Power Gang,

02:54.030 --> 02:55.360
aside from Liu Suifeng,

02:56.030 --> 02:58.150
who else would have been so ruthless?

03:01.080 --> 03:01.800
Yulan.

03:03.430 --> 03:04.470
Think carefully.

03:05.680 --> 03:07.810
Is there anything else that feels off?

03:35.750 --> 03:39.400
Ten o'clock in the evening.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.840
Liu Suifeng.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.610
Last night I came to the study
to see Father

03:43.710 --> 03:45.840
and saw Liu Suifeng coming out.

03:46.710 --> 03:47.310
No,

03:48.590 --> 03:49.590
that's not right.

03:49.960 --> 03:52.000
I came to see Father at midnight.

03:53.079 --> 03:55.120
Yulan, are you mistaken?

03:55.520 --> 03:56.190
No.

03:57.310 --> 03:58.240
It was 10 PM.

04:01.360 --> 04:02.240
That means…

04:04.840 --> 04:06.640
someone else must've been here.

04:28.270 --> 04:30.920
How long has your father been unconscious?

04:31.830 --> 04:34.960
Until recently,
he could stay lucid for about two hours.

04:36.159 --> 04:38.680
But the past two days,
he's been in a deep sleep.

04:38.680 --> 04:42.720
Given his condition,
he won't last half a month.

04:43.270 --> 04:44.800
I know a special treatment,

04:45.120 --> 04:49.070
but it has a 50% chance of failure.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.120
If it fails,

04:51.870 --> 04:54.120
your father won't last seven days.

04:54.720 --> 04:56.050
Whether to try it or not,

04:56.630 --> 04:57.870
consider carefully.

05:03.560 --> 05:05.430
Move aside. Let me in.

05:06.310 --> 05:07.040
Go away!

05:12.680 --> 05:13.360
What is it?

05:13.870 --> 05:16.120
Old Madam Tang heard
the Herbal King is here

05:16.120 --> 05:18.160
and specially sent me
to deliver the Nourishment Soup

05:18.160 --> 05:19.360
to aid his treatment.

05:19.870 --> 05:21.130
Please let me through.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.270
That's thoughtful of Old Madam Tang.

05:25.270 --> 05:27.530
But the Herbal King is
only here as a guest

05:27.630 --> 05:30.160
to discuss poison techniques
with my father.

05:30.480 --> 05:33.510
He doesn't need this soup for now.

05:35.720 --> 05:38.980
Who would dare poison the soup
in the Old Madam Tang's name?

05:39.159 --> 05:40.870
You don't need to be so wary.

05:43.630 --> 05:44.270
Miss,

05:45.510 --> 05:46.970
it's a misunderstanding.

05:47.870 --> 05:48.510
Miss,

05:49.390 --> 05:52.310
Master is indeed in good health.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.560
If it were a common tonic,

05:54.920 --> 05:56.040
I'd just accept it.

05:56.870 --> 05:59.120
But such a potent life-saving medicine

06:00.310 --> 06:01.440
isn't appropriate.

06:04.160 --> 06:04.830
Fine.

06:06.040 --> 06:07.870
Master rarely appears in public,

06:07.870 --> 06:10.070
so Old Madam Tang thought he was ill.

06:10.830 --> 06:13.270
She said
if he can't manage the Tang Sect anymore,

06:13.270 --> 06:15.200
he should make arrangements soon.

06:15.720 --> 06:18.600
But I reassured her

06:19.480 --> 06:20.880
that Master is only busy.

06:21.360 --> 06:24.020
He'll certainly attend
the mid-month meeting,

06:25.310 --> 06:25.920
won't he?

06:26.630 --> 06:27.630
Of course he will.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.240
You may go.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.380
There's no escape either way.

06:53.750 --> 06:54.870
Herbal King,

06:56.310 --> 06:58.909
please do whatever is needed
to save my father.

07:01.870 --> 07:02.470
All right.

07:02.950 --> 07:04.350
I'll make preparations.

08:24.270 --> 08:24.920
Yuhan.

08:26.750 --> 08:29.080
There's something in Uncle Deng's mouth.

08:38.510 --> 08:39.480
Tieyi?

08:40.320 --> 08:42.120
Could it be the Constable Tieyi?

08:47.910 --> 08:49.710
Uncle Tieyi was a righteous man.

08:50.390 --> 08:52.320
He was my father's dearest friend.

08:52.670 --> 08:54.730
When the Sword Manor was under siege,

08:55.270 --> 08:57.130
he sacrificed his life to help us.

08:58.870 --> 09:00.200
Could he still be alive?

09:01.790 --> 09:03.520
Let's find him and get answers.

09:05.670 --> 09:07.530
After the fall of the Sword Manor,

09:07.790 --> 09:09.190
his body was never found.

09:09.960 --> 09:12.960
Several corpses were burned
beyond recognition.

09:13.240 --> 09:14.900
We can't be sure if one was his.

09:16.320 --> 09:19.750
Everyone assumes he died in battle
at the Sword Manor.

09:20.510 --> 09:22.170
But with so many people there,

09:23.360 --> 09:23.960
why was his body

09:23.960 --> 09:25.510
the only body missing?

09:27.030 --> 09:29.790
My father did hide something

09:30.240 --> 09:31.960
about what happened in Baicao Valley.

09:31.960 --> 09:32.470
But

09:33.390 --> 09:35.990
what does that have to do
with Constable Tieyi?

09:36.360 --> 09:37.720
I'm not sure yet.

09:38.670 --> 09:40.200
But I'm certain

09:40.790 --> 09:42.050
that someone is trying

09:43.030 --> 09:44.750
to stop us
from digging further into the person

09:44.750 --> 09:46.810
with the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

09:52.550 --> 09:53.200
Yuhan,

09:54.960 --> 09:56.960
if it weren't for my investigation,

09:57.360 --> 09:58.270
Uncle Deng

10:00.630 --> 10:02.490
might not have ended up like this.

10:05.670 --> 10:06.320
I'm sorry.

10:13.390 --> 10:14.120
Big Brother,

10:16.390 --> 10:17.650
this isn't your fault.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.010
We have to avenge

10:22.480 --> 10:23.960
the Huanhua Sect

10:24.510 --> 10:25.640
and the Hailin Sect.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.980
This villain is utterly vicious.

10:29.080 --> 10:30.280
If we can't catch him,

10:31.320 --> 10:33.960
I fear our families

10:35.080 --> 10:36.750
won't be his last victims.

10:42.630 --> 10:43.360
Big Brother,

10:44.630 --> 10:45.360
don't worry.

10:46.750 --> 10:48.390
I'll never let this break me

10:49.390 --> 10:52.080
or bow to that murderer.

10:53.510 --> 10:56.110
We must find that scourge
of the martial world.

10:56.120 --> 10:58.850
Once I've buried my father
and fellow disciples,

11:00.030 --> 11:02.360
I'll come to help you
hunt down the killer.

11:09.080 --> 11:09.630
Yuhan,

11:10.270 --> 11:11.730
can you handle this alone?

11:12.910 --> 11:14.150
All I want now

11:15.910 --> 11:19.320
is to make the killer pay with his life.

11:25.080 --> 11:25.630
Good.

11:26.720 --> 11:29.910
I'll definitely find him.

11:31.910 --> 11:32.640
Big Brother,

11:35.790 --> 11:36.600
be careful.

12:20.270 --> 12:20.730
Father.

12:23.550 --> 12:24.010
Father!

12:25.150 --> 12:25.610
Father!

12:28.960 --> 12:29.510
Father.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.790
I've done everything I could.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.390
Miss,

12:38.960 --> 12:39.890
my condolences.

12:48.790 --> 12:50.840
I know you have great skills,

12:51.870 --> 12:54.070
unmatched in both medicine and poison.

12:55.150 --> 12:56.950
You treat illness and save lives

12:58.480 --> 13:00.210
with unconventional methods.

13:00.240 --> 13:00.970
Herbal King,

13:02.480 --> 13:04.010
please think of another way

13:04.240 --> 13:05.240
to save my father.

13:05.790 --> 13:06.590
Please get up.

13:06.720 --> 13:07.550
Please get up.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.200
Please don't do this.

13:12.240 --> 13:13.030
There is

13:13.870 --> 13:14.800
another method.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.390
But for you,

13:17.550 --> 13:19.550
it's far too dangerous.

13:21.480 --> 13:22.390
For me?

13:26.480 --> 13:27.540
Whatever it takes,

13:28.080 --> 13:29.240
as long as it can save my father,

13:29.240 --> 13:30.300
I'm willing to try.

13:30.910 --> 13:34.000
It's a method
of fighting poison with poison.

13:34.720 --> 13:37.910
Someone must first
take my specially prepared poison

13:38.960 --> 13:42.960
and then transfer
internal energy to the patient.

13:43.320 --> 13:45.630
Two poisons will clash
until one fades.

13:46.270 --> 13:48.870
It might bring your father
back from the brink.

13:49.510 --> 13:51.310
But with the slightest mistake,

13:51.910 --> 13:53.570
not only will your father die,

13:54.670 --> 13:57.600
but your own life may be lost too.

14:14.030 --> 14:15.690
Please, teach me this method.

14:16.720 --> 14:17.580
No matter what,

14:18.240 --> 14:19.440
I must save my father.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.790
Then I'll grant your filial wish.

15:48.790 --> 15:49.440
Miss,

15:51.270 --> 15:52.730
let's stop here for today.

15:53.550 --> 15:55.270
We mustn't rush things.

16:11.750 --> 16:15.150
We'll raise the dosage
when treatment begins.

16:35.080 --> 16:35.600
Father.

16:46.270 --> 16:47.080
Fang.

16:50.240 --> 16:50.910
I…

16:54.270 --> 16:55.800
have become a burden to you.

16:56.360 --> 16:58.090
As long as you're safe, Father,

16:58.320 --> 16:59.480
I'll do anything.

17:11.680 --> 17:13.680
Who would go so far
as to slaughter the Deng family?

17:13.680 --> 17:14.510
We don't know yet.

17:14.510 --> 17:15.720
But Big Brother is looking into it.

17:15.720 --> 17:17.510
I believe he'll uncover the truth.

17:17.510 --> 17:18.680
Once we find the killer,

17:18.680 --> 17:20.680
we'll help Yuhan avenge his family.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.740
Where is Yuhan now?

17:22.440 --> 17:23.839
He's in mourning at home.

17:23.920 --> 17:25.680
But I've already written to him.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.920
If he needs us,

17:27.030 --> 17:28.630
we'll go to him immediately.

17:29.110 --> 17:30.680
Then let's ask around the martial world

17:30.680 --> 17:31.680
to see if there are any clues.

17:31.680 --> 17:32.280
All right.

17:32.430 --> 17:32.960
Let's go.

17:38.590 --> 17:41.480
They say a heroine came to town,
going everywhere

17:41.720 --> 17:42.920
to treat the disaster victims.

17:42.920 --> 17:44.070
That must be you.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.030
I just did what I could.

17:48.270 --> 17:48.920
Kaiyan,

17:49.310 --> 17:51.170
why have you come so late to see me?

17:55.480 --> 17:57.540
There's been no word of Yiren lately.

17:57.720 --> 17:59.880
I wonder how he's doing.

18:00.240 --> 18:03.270
How's it possible that he's colluded
with the Northern Wastelanders

18:03.270 --> 18:05.130
and openly betrayed the country?

18:06.350 --> 18:08.150
I've also sent men to ask around,

18:09.270 --> 18:11.070
but there is still no word of him.

18:13.960 --> 18:15.560
I thought of going to find him

18:16.070 --> 18:18.550
and bring him back to explain himself.

18:19.960 --> 18:22.920
But I couldn't stop worrying about you.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.640
Kaiyan, you worry too much.

18:29.750 --> 18:31.510
I'm fine here.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.680
How could I not worry?

18:38.160 --> 18:39.920
If anything happened to you,

18:40.590 --> 18:41.720
how would I face

18:41.750 --> 18:43.550
Father and Mother in heaven?

18:45.070 --> 18:47.110
When our parents took you in,

18:48.030 --> 18:50.070
I saw you as my own sister.

18:51.510 --> 18:52.350
Of course…

18:54.960 --> 18:57.720
sometimes not just as a sister.

19:02.110 --> 19:02.830
Kaiyan,

19:04.310 --> 19:05.840
why say this all of a sudden?

19:10.920 --> 19:12.000
I know

19:13.720 --> 19:15.200
you once

19:16.510 --> 19:17.440
admired Yiren.

19:20.030 --> 19:22.960
I only see him as my elder brother.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.310
And I see you

19:24.920 --> 19:26.070
the same way.

19:27.590 --> 19:28.590
I also know

19:29.480 --> 19:32.200
Yiren put you through a lot that day.

19:33.920 --> 19:36.200
There's no need to bring up the past.

19:38.070 --> 19:39.600
I'm part of the Xiao family.

19:39.920 --> 19:41.310
When the family was in trouble,

19:41.310 --> 19:42.710
it was my duty to stand up.

19:43.960 --> 19:44.680
Now,

19:45.790 --> 19:47.510
we're the only Xiaos left.

19:48.510 --> 19:49.680
So no matter what,

19:50.680 --> 19:52.280
you'll always be my brother.

20:02.240 --> 20:04.310
I heard that the traitor escaped here.

20:04.310 --> 20:06.240
We must catch him if we run into him.

20:06.680 --> 20:09.480
The eldest son of the Xiao family colluded
with the Northern Wastelanders.

20:09.480 --> 20:11.400
Who is this person in black?

20:12.310 --> 20:14.030
He made me end up like this.

20:15.030 --> 20:16.590
I have to find out who he is

20:17.240 --> 20:18.960
to clear my name.

20:23.590 --> 20:24.310
Xiaoyi?

20:26.720 --> 20:27.350
Yiren.

20:31.350 --> 20:32.310
Why are you here?

20:33.750 --> 20:35.750
I searched every town along the way.

20:36.720 --> 20:38.000
I finally found you.

20:39.160 --> 20:39.790
Yiren,

20:40.720 --> 20:42.250
come back with me, will you?

20:42.510 --> 20:44.680
Let's go back
and explain everything to everyone.

20:44.680 --> 20:45.160
No.

20:46.350 --> 20:48.070
Until I find the one who framed me,

20:48.070 --> 20:49.070
I won't return.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.510
Please don't leave.

20:54.310 --> 20:56.200
It took me so long to find you.

20:57.480 --> 20:59.270
If you go now, I don't know

20:59.270 --> 21:00.670
when I can find you again.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.280
Why are you still looking for me?

21:03.960 --> 21:06.030
I'm not who I used to be.

21:06.480 --> 21:09.270
Everyone thinks I've colluded
with the Northern Wastelanders

21:09.270 --> 21:11.270
and that I'm a disgrace
to the martial world.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.920
I'm like a rat in the street now—

21:12.920 --> 21:14.030
everyone despises me.

21:14.030 --> 21:14.920
I don't care.

21:18.110 --> 21:19.570
I don't care what happened

21:19.960 --> 21:21.510
or what anyone says.

21:25.440 --> 21:26.640
I only believe in you.

21:31.070 --> 21:31.530
Come on.

21:31.680 --> 21:33.340
What if we really run into him?

21:34.070 --> 21:35.870
This martial world is a mess now.

21:36.240 --> 21:38.680
Even the Deng family,
who always kept to themselves,

21:38.680 --> 21:39.510
was wiped out by the Power Gang

21:39.510 --> 21:41.550
for some unknown reason.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.270
All the dishes are here.

21:43.270 --> 21:44.030
Did you hear?

21:44.680 --> 21:46.510
The Fei family,
one of the Three Mystical Families—

21:46.510 --> 21:47.920
its family leader, Mr. Fei,

21:47.920 --> 21:51.880
suddenly announced he'd withdraw
from the martial world in three days.

21:51.880 --> 21:52.750
Withdraw?

21:52.750 --> 21:53.400
Yes.

21:55.110 --> 21:56.750
By the rules of the martial world,

21:56.750 --> 21:58.010
after the withdrawal,

21:58.750 --> 22:01.070
one will no longer be involved
in martial world affairs.

22:01.070 --> 22:03.680
All their secrets
will be taken to the grave.

22:04.070 --> 22:05.600
I need to get there quickly.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.610
Take your medicine.

22:57.720 --> 23:00.320
The treasures brought back
from Nantian Abyss

23:00.680 --> 23:01.940
have all been tallied.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.740
As you instructed,

23:04.440 --> 23:07.240
90% has been exchanged
for food and warm clothing.

23:07.680 --> 23:10.340
The remaining 10% has been sent
to various sects

23:10.750 --> 23:13.480
and the families of those
who died in battle.

23:14.240 --> 23:17.110
Everything's already
loaded onto the boats.

23:17.680 --> 23:19.140
They can set out tomorrow.

23:22.070 --> 23:22.750
Good.

23:25.070 --> 23:27.000
I'll head to the capital tomorrow.

23:28.920 --> 23:30.120
I don't want you to go.

23:40.310 --> 23:40.960
Shirong,

23:42.880 --> 23:44.540
you're being childish again.

23:49.310 --> 23:50.240
Every time…

23:50.960 --> 23:52.960
every time you return from the palace,

23:52.960 --> 23:54.400
your health gets worse.

23:55.310 --> 23:57.710
Don't think I don't know what's happening.

24:05.030 --> 24:06.560
He just wants to control you

24:06.880 --> 24:08.310
and torture you slowly.

24:10.920 --> 24:12.650
But for what we want to achieve…

24:14.880 --> 24:15.960
I can endure it.

24:17.750 --> 24:20.350
How long do you have to
keep enduring like this?

24:30.310 --> 24:31.240
Since you know,

24:32.790 --> 24:33.440
Shirong,

24:35.310 --> 24:35.920
why don't you

24:35.920 --> 24:37.680
let me finish what I need to do?

24:39.350 --> 24:41.270
Once he gets what he wants,

24:42.960 --> 24:44.690
he won't be restless every day.

24:47.510 --> 24:49.590
Suspicion has no end.

24:50.240 --> 24:52.240
Even if you think for him in everything,

24:52.240 --> 24:54.110
he still distrusts you.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.830
He does.

25:03.880 --> 25:05.210
But what does it matter?

25:06.310 --> 25:09.480
I do what I do only for what I believe in.

25:13.550 --> 25:15.880
As long as the country prospers
and the people live in peace,

25:15.880 --> 25:18.720
nothing else matters.

25:26.310 --> 25:27.590
So you don't even

25:27.590 --> 25:28.990
care about your own life?

25:31.920 --> 25:33.250
This trip to the capital

25:35.070 --> 25:36.920
may be very dangerous.

25:38.550 --> 25:40.200
Let me go with you.

25:55.680 --> 25:56.410
Don't worry.

25:58.590 --> 26:02.200
As long as the court needs me,

26:04.110 --> 26:05.790
they have to keep me alive.

26:07.920 --> 26:08.550
Shirong,

26:09.310 --> 26:10.070
don't worry.

26:12.160 --> 26:15.440
I'll return safely this time.

26:24.680 --> 26:26.140
Take your medicine first.

26:50.510 --> 26:52.920
Are you here for the young master's
coming-of-age ceremony?

26:52.920 --> 26:54.380
Do you have an invitation?

26:54.590 --> 26:57.790
I'm here on behalf of Prince Liang Dou,
the Glow Achiever,

26:57.880 --> 27:00.030
to deliver a letter
to the master of the Fei family.

27:00.030 --> 27:01.160
Please announce me.

27:02.590 --> 27:03.520
One moment, sir.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.480
Sir,

27:09.510 --> 27:11.710
you can't enter without an invitation.

27:15.310 --> 27:16.310
I'd like to see

27:16.720 --> 27:18.920
what scheme you're plotting this time.

27:31.510 --> 27:33.400
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

27:33.720 --> 27:36.640
I'm aware of Prince Liang's investigation.

27:36.880 --> 27:39.160
Since you've come so far with this letter,

27:39.160 --> 27:41.480
please stay and rest for a few days.

27:42.350 --> 27:43.410
Thank you, Mr. Fei.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.200
I came here

27:45.310 --> 27:46.570
with another request.

27:47.030 --> 27:47.750
What is it?

27:48.680 --> 27:50.510
As long as I can help,

27:50.920 --> 27:53.270
and it doesn't go against martial honor,

27:53.750 --> 27:55.350
I will certainly assist you.

27:55.510 --> 27:56.350
Mr. Fei,

27:57.590 --> 28:01.070
have you ever practiced a technique
called the Marrow-Disrupting Finger?

28:01.070 --> 28:04.590
So you came for that too.

28:05.110 --> 28:07.200
That technique causes great harm.

28:07.680 --> 28:09.940
It should have been eradicated long ago.

28:10.310 --> 28:13.000
Forgive me, but I cannot teach it to you.

28:13.030 --> 28:14.630
Mr. Fei, you misunderstood.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.310
I don't wish to learn it.

28:16.680 --> 28:19.110
I just want you to use it

28:20.070 --> 28:22.200
to confirm my parents' cause of death.

28:22.590 --> 28:24.000
Your parents?

28:26.110 --> 28:27.160
Xiao Xilou

28:28.750 --> 28:29.960
and Sun Huishan.

28:32.030 --> 28:33.030
I am Xiao Qiushui.

28:36.510 --> 28:37.440
I heard

28:37.880 --> 28:41.310
you're friends
with Deng Qingfeng's son, Deng Yuhan.

28:41.960 --> 28:45.070
Did you slaughter the Deng family

28:45.510 --> 28:47.480
to investigate
the Marrow-Disrupting Finger?

28:47.480 --> 28:48.880
I'd never have done that.

28:50.310 --> 28:52.040
Deng Yuhan is my sworn brother.

28:52.440 --> 28:54.880
How could I have harmed his family?

28:55.270 --> 28:58.310
Someone must have framed me.

28:58.880 --> 29:00.680
If you doubt me because of this,

29:01.070 --> 29:02.800
you've fallen into their trap.

29:03.880 --> 29:06.310
How am I supposed to believe you?

29:06.720 --> 29:08.720
Mr. Fei, you don't have to believe me.

29:08.720 --> 29:09.980
But if I were sinister,

29:11.070 --> 29:12.330
why would Mr. Liang Dou

29:12.510 --> 29:15.750
have entrusted me with this letter?

29:16.590 --> 29:17.920
You have a point.

29:18.920 --> 29:21.380
Mr. Liang's martial skills are formidable.

29:21.590 --> 29:23.920
You couldn't have stolen it from him.

29:24.240 --> 29:24.920
Forget it.

29:25.510 --> 29:28.480
Tomorrow, my eldest grandson
will have his coming-of-age ceremony,

29:28.480 --> 29:30.920
and I'll withdraw from the martial world.

29:31.240 --> 29:33.680
I don't want any trouble before then.

29:34.070 --> 29:35.070
After tomorrow,

29:35.440 --> 29:38.110
once I've laid down my burden,

29:38.680 --> 29:39.920
I'll try it for you.

29:42.270 --> 29:43.330
Thank you, Mr. Fei.

29:44.440 --> 29:47.240
While everyone is gathered
in the ancestral hall,

29:47.440 --> 29:49.110
search the place in secret.

29:50.510 --> 29:52.310
I don't believe
the Thousand-Faces Mask was destroyed.

29:52.310 --> 29:52.970
-Yes.
-Yes.

30:16.720 --> 30:18.830
Mr. Fei.

30:38.070 --> 30:41.070
Today is the day
for my grandson's coming-of-age ceremony

30:41.070 --> 30:44.590
and the day the Fei family withdraws

30:45.110 --> 30:46.960
from the martial world.

30:47.510 --> 30:48.960
From this day on,

30:49.440 --> 30:52.960
my descendants will only engage
in business and scholarly pursuits

30:52.960 --> 30:54.820
and stay out of the martial world.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.510
Stay out of martial world affairs?

30:56.510 --> 30:58.160
Are they withdrawing
from the martial world?

30:58.160 --> 30:59.310
Chengqing

30:59.510 --> 31:02.070
has always disliked
martial arts since childhood.

31:02.070 --> 31:04.640
He only loves practical learning.

31:05.310 --> 31:07.570
He's most suitable to be the family head.

31:09.070 --> 31:10.000
But

31:10.240 --> 31:13.310
all of you here
have close ties with my family—

31:14.590 --> 31:17.070
some are friends, some are foes.

31:18.310 --> 31:20.270
I've invited you here today

31:20.550 --> 31:21.960
to wipe the slate clean.

31:25.160 --> 31:26.270
It's not that easy.

31:26.310 --> 31:26.840
Dream on!

31:27.480 --> 31:29.000
To wipe the slate clean?

31:29.680 --> 31:30.960
Withdrawing from the martial world?

31:30.960 --> 31:31.720
Yes.

31:31.960 --> 31:32.880
What a shame.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.680
The giant is falling,

31:36.680 --> 31:39.310
and the vultures can't wait
to drink its blood.

31:42.510 --> 31:43.270
Mr. Fei,

31:43.720 --> 31:45.070
your son Fei Danfeng

31:45.440 --> 31:47.110
once severed my brother's arm.

31:47.110 --> 31:49.040
If you want to wipe the slate clean,

31:49.070 --> 31:52.310
you should offer some unique techniques
as compensation.

31:52.310 --> 31:53.640
Yes, that's right.

31:53.920 --> 31:54.590
Mr. Fei,

31:54.880 --> 31:56.480
hand over the Thousand-Faces Mask now!

31:56.480 --> 31:56.680
Yes!

31:56.680 --> 31:59.830
-Yes, hand it over!
-Hand it over!

31:59.880 --> 32:02.070
-Hand it over!
-Hand it over!

32:02.070 --> 32:02.870
Grandfather.

32:03.920 --> 32:04.960
What should we do?

32:08.310 --> 32:11.160
So you're all
after the Thousand-Faces Mask.

32:11.590 --> 32:14.310
Then I'll tell you its whereabouts.

32:16.590 --> 32:17.830
Five years ago,

32:17.880 --> 32:21.510
my eldest son, Danfeng,
took it to carry out imperial orders

32:22.480 --> 32:24.280
but was brutally assassinated.

32:24.920 --> 32:27.240
His body was never found.

32:28.030 --> 32:30.290
That item was destroyed that very night.

32:30.550 --> 32:33.070
Only a scrap of charred skin remained.

32:33.350 --> 32:35.960
I buried it in the ancestral tomb.

32:36.270 --> 32:36.750
You...

32:37.110 --> 32:38.310
How is that possible?

32:38.310 --> 32:39.510
That's nonsense.

32:39.720 --> 32:40.510
Yeah.

32:42.070 --> 32:43.270
You must hand it over.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.970
How could it have been burned?

32:45.070 --> 32:48.680
To keep the Fei family
from sinking deeper into misery,

32:49.030 --> 32:52.310
I swore an oath that day:

32:53.110 --> 32:55.000
anyone in the Fei family

32:55.790 --> 32:58.790
who dares to secretly use
the Thousand-Faces Mask

32:59.270 --> 33:01.070
will have their martial arts crippled

33:01.070 --> 33:02.870
and be banished from the family.

33:05.510 --> 33:06.000
No way.

33:06.030 --> 33:07.360
He really destroyed it?

33:14.270 --> 33:15.670
With so many people here,

33:15.880 --> 33:17.110
you still dare

33:17.110 --> 33:18.840
to tell such an outrageous lie!

33:19.160 --> 33:20.720
Hand over the Thousand-Faces Mask.

33:20.720 --> 33:22.920
We won't make things difficult for you.

33:23.270 --> 33:25.030
You two family traitors!

33:25.510 --> 33:27.040
You broke the family rules,

33:27.070 --> 33:28.550
secretly using the Thousand-Faces Mask

33:28.550 --> 33:29.680
without scruple.

33:30.310 --> 33:32.310
I already cast you out.

33:32.880 --> 33:35.070
How dare you show up here today?

33:35.510 --> 33:38.370
If you had taught us
this secret technique earlier,

33:38.480 --> 33:40.720
we wouldn't have had to
kill so many people.

33:40.720 --> 33:42.440
How many times have I told you?

33:42.960 --> 33:44.890
That thing is not in my possession!

33:45.110 --> 33:47.720
You two, get out of here now!

33:49.590 --> 33:50.790
I didn't expect this.

33:51.880 --> 33:53.210
Keeping it to yourself—

33:53.350 --> 33:55.150
what kind of withdrawal is this?

33:55.510 --> 33:56.960
Better to destroy it here and now,

33:56.960 --> 33:58.030
with everyone as witness.

33:58.030 --> 34:00.430
-That's right. Hand it over!
-Hand it over!

34:00.510 --> 34:02.550
-Hand it over!
-Hand it over!

34:02.550 --> 34:04.510
-Hand it over!
-Hand it over!

34:04.510 --> 34:06.570
You must have it hidden. Hand it over!

34:06.880 --> 34:07.590
Enough!

34:13.760 --> 34:16.110
I've already withdrawn
from the martial world,

34:16.110 --> 34:18.230
yet you still push me so hard.

34:19.320 --> 34:19.960
Fine.

34:20.510 --> 34:23.320
Even if it breaks the rules
of withdrawal today,

34:24.110 --> 34:25.760
I'll fight you to the end.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.010
Come on then.

34:28.960 --> 34:30.820
Who will be the first challenger?

35:26.360 --> 35:27.110
Grandfather!

35:27.110 --> 35:29.800
He's already struggling
against two juniors.

35:30.110 --> 35:30.770
It seems...

35:47.670 --> 35:49.710
Is it him?
Xiao Qiushui from the Xiao family?

35:49.710 --> 35:50.840
-Yes.
-Why is he here?

35:50.840 --> 35:51.320
Why is he here?

35:51.320 --> 35:52.250
What's going on?

36:05.960 --> 36:09.490
You're an outsider. Why are you
meddling in our family affairs?

36:22.880 --> 36:24.070
What I can't stand most

36:24.070 --> 36:25.930
is bullying the old and the young.

36:26.480 --> 36:29.550
So today, I must interfere.

36:31.960 --> 36:32.800
Xiao Qiushui.

36:34.510 --> 36:36.800
Better mind your own family affairs.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.920
Your eldest brother colluded
with the Northern Wastelanders.

36:39.920 --> 36:41.190
As his brother,

36:41.320 --> 36:43.510
how dare you interfere
in the matters of Daxi's martial world?

36:43.510 --> 36:45.360
What nonsense are you talking about?

36:45.360 --> 36:46.840
You just slaughtered the Deng family,

36:46.840 --> 36:48.320
and now you're here
to cause trouble again.

36:48.320 --> 36:49.320
We outnumber you.

36:49.550 --> 36:50.810
If you dare make a move,

36:51.150 --> 36:52.840
you won't walk away unscathed!

36:52.840 --> 36:54.880
-That's right!
-Yes, that's right.

36:54.880 --> 36:56.030
You'll regret it!

36:56.070 --> 36:56.870
That's right.

36:56.920 --> 36:57.480
Exactly!

36:57.880 --> 36:58.920
Mind your own business!

36:58.920 --> 36:59.670
Step aside!

36:59.670 --> 37:00.510
-Move away!
-Yes, move!

37:00.510 --> 37:01.840
-Move!
-Step aside now!

37:02.880 --> 37:04.480
I have questions for Mr. Fei.

37:05.840 --> 37:07.320
So I must protect him.

37:09.590 --> 37:11.050
How about this, everyone?

37:11.670 --> 37:12.670
Let's make a bet.

37:14.070 --> 37:15.280
If you win,

37:15.840 --> 37:19.510
I'll no longer interfere in this matter.

37:23.590 --> 37:24.920
And if we refuse?

37:29.320 --> 37:30.920
Then your lives are at stake.

37:44.440 --> 37:45.300
What's the bet?

37:55.840 --> 37:56.710
If anyone here

37:57.670 --> 37:58.670
can pull the sword

37:59.070 --> 38:01.280
completely out of the stone,

38:01.710 --> 38:03.630
I'll never meddle in this again.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.150
But if you can't,

38:06.880 --> 38:07.680
you'll have to

38:08.480 --> 38:10.030
leave the Fei family alone.

38:10.880 --> 38:13.480
And you two must also
give Mr. Fei the antidote.

38:14.150 --> 38:14.680
Brother,

38:15.440 --> 38:16.570
don't agree to this.

38:17.320 --> 38:19.510
This guy's internal energy is immense.

38:19.510 --> 38:20.570
It might be a trick.

38:20.920 --> 38:21.920
It's just a sword.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.210
Let's give it a try.

38:24.960 --> 38:25.510
Fine.

38:26.110 --> 38:26.840
We accept.

38:28.320 --> 38:32.120
If anyone goes back on this bet,
the martial world will be after them!

38:39.760 --> 38:41.360
My two rebellious children—

38:41.480 --> 38:42.840
one has mastered
the Sky-Supporting Technique,

38:42.840 --> 38:44.110
with limitless palm strength;

38:44.110 --> 38:45.550
the other has mastered
the Transformation Technique,

38:45.550 --> 38:46.840
making heavy objects feel light.

38:46.840 --> 38:48.880
What if they actually win?

38:49.480 --> 38:50.150
They won't.

39:19.880 --> 39:22.480
Xiao Qiushui, you never said

39:22.710 --> 39:24.960
we couldn't pull it out together.

39:25.510 --> 39:28.320
I said you need
to pull the sword out of the stone.

39:29.150 --> 39:31.190
But there's still stone on the sword.

39:31.190 --> 39:33.320
Yes, the stone's still clinging to it.

40:04.920 --> 40:07.720
The smaller the stone,
the harder it is to shatter.

40:08.590 --> 40:10.120
With your internal energy,

40:10.360 --> 40:11.690
you'll never get it out.

40:12.710 --> 40:15.110
So, do you admit defeat now?

40:16.670 --> 40:17.330
We admit it.

40:17.510 --> 40:18.310
The antidote.

40:30.710 --> 40:31.510
Grandfather.

40:43.440 --> 40:44.500
The bet is settled.

40:44.710 --> 40:47.840
From now on, the Fei family is
not to be messed with again.

40:49.670 --> 40:52.190
Guys, please see yourselves out.

40:53.070 --> 40:54.670
We came for nothing. Let's go.

40:54.670 --> 40:57.070
What a pity about the Thousand-Faces Mask.

40:57.320 --> 40:58.850
We pressured him this much,

40:59.670 --> 41:01.510
yet he still says he doesn't have it.

41:01.510 --> 41:02.770
It must really be gone.

41:03.280 --> 41:03.810
Let's go.

41:06.670 --> 41:07.190
Master.

41:07.840 --> 41:08.320
Master.

41:08.670 --> 41:09.190
Master.

41:09.480 --> 41:11.320
The ancestral tomb has been dug up!
